0	section	Glough
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	box	The gnome is munching on a worm hole.
1	line	Glough	Can I help human? Can't you see I'm eating?!
1	box	The gnome continues to eat.
1	line	Player	The King asked me to inform you that the Daconia rocks have been taken!
1	line	Glough	Surely not!
