0	section	Reporting to the King
1	line	Player	Hello, your highness. Have you any news on the Daconia stones?
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	It's OK Traveller, thanks to Glough! He found a human sneaking around! He had three Daconia rocks on him!
1	line	Player	Wow! That was quick!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Yes Glough really knows what he's doing. The human has been detained until we know who else is involved.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Maybe Glough was right, maybe humans are invading!
1	line	Player	I doubt it, can I speak to the prisoner?
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Certainly. He's on the top level of the tree. Be careful, it's a long way down!
1	action	end
