0	section	Suspicions
1	line	Player	Glough! I don't know what you're up to but I know you paid Charlie to get those rocks!
1	line	Glough	You're a fool human! You have no idea what's going on.
1	line	Player	I know the Grand Tree's dying! And I think you're part of the reason.
1	line	Glough	How dare you accuse me! I'm the head tree guardian!
1	line	Glough	Guards! Guards!
1	line	Gnome guard	Come with me!
0	section	Imprisoned
1	line	Charlie	So they got you as well?
1	line	Player	It's Glough! He's trying to cover something up.
1	line	Charlie	I shouldn't tell you this adventurer. But if you want to get to the bottom of this you should go and talk to the Karamja Shipyard foreman.
1	line	Player	Why?
1	line	Charlie	Glough sent me to Karamja to meet him. I delivered a large amount of gold. For what? I don't know. He may be able to tell you what Glough's up to. That's if you can get out of here. You'll find him
1	line	Charlie	in the Karamja Shipyard, east of Shilo Village. Be careful! If he discovers you're not working for Glough, there'll be trouble! The sea men use the password Ka-Lu-Min.
1	line	Player	Thanks Charlie!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Traveller please accept my apologies! Glough had no right to arrest you! I just think he's scared of humans. Let me get you out of there.
1	line	Player	I don't think you can trust Glough, your highness. He seems to have an unnatural hatred for humans.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I know he can be a bit extreme at times. But he's the best tree guardian I have, he has made the gnomes paranoid about humans though.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I'm afraid Glough has placed guards on the front gate to stop you escaping! Let my glider pilot fly you away until things calm down around here.
1	line	Player	Well, OK.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I'm sorry again Traveller!
1	action	end
