0	section	Foreman
1	line	Player	Hello, are you in charge?
1	line	Foreman	That's right, and you are...?
1	line	Player	Glough sent me to check on how you are doing.
1	line	Foreman	Right. Glough sent a human?
1	line	Player	His gnomes are busy.
1	line	Foreman	Hmm...in that case we'd better go to my office. Follow me.
1	line	Foreman	Tell me again why you're here.
1	line	Player	Er...Glough sent me?
1	line	Foreman	By the way how is Glough? Still with his wife?
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes, they're getting on great.
2	line	Player	Yes, they're getting on great.
2	line	Foreman	Really? That's odd, considering she died last year. Die imposter!
2	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
1	option	Always arguing as usual!
2	line	Player	Always arguing as usual!
2	line	Foreman	Really? That's odd, considering she died last year. Die imposter!
2	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
1	option	Sadly his wife is no longer with us!
2	line	Player	Sadly his wife is no longer with us!
2	line	Foreman	Right answer. I have to watch for imposters. What's Glough's favourite dish?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	He loves tangled toads legs.
3	line	Player	He loves tangled toads legs.
3	line	Foreman	Our survey said.... Bzzzzzz! Wrong answer!
3	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
2	option	He loves worm holes.
3	line	Player	He loves worm holes.
3	line	Foreman	OK. Just one more. What's the name of his new girlfriend?
3	select	Select an option
3	option	Anita.
4	line	Player	Anita.
4	line	Foreman	Well, well, you do know Glough. Sorry for the interrogation but I'm sure you understand.
4	line	Player	Of course, security is paramount.
4	line	Foreman	As you can see things are going well.
4	line	Player	Indeed.
4	line	Foreman	When I was asked to build a fleet large enough to invade Port Sarim and carry 300 gnome troops I said: 'If anyone can, I can.'
4	line	Player	That's a lot of troops!
4	line	Foreman	True but if the gnomes are really going to take over Gielinor they'll need at least that.
4	line	Player	Take over?
4	line	Foreman	Of course, why else would Glough want 30 battleships? Between you and me I don't think he stands a chance.
4	line	Player	No?
4	line	Foreman	I mean, for the kind of battleships Glough's ordered I'll need tons and tons of lumber! Still, if he says he can supply the wood I'm sure he can! Anyway, here's the order for the lumber.
4	action	The foreman has given you the lumber order.
4	action	
4	line	Player	OK. I'll head off and give this order to Glough.
4	action	end
3	option	Alia.
4	line	Player	Alia.
4	line	Foreman	You almost had me fooled! Die imposter!
4	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
3	option	Elena.
4	line	Player	Elena.
4	line	Foreman	You almost had me fooled! Die imposter!
4	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
2	option	He loves choc bombs.
3	line	Player	He loves tangled toads legs.
3	line	Foreman	Our survey said.... Bzzzzzz! Wrong answer!
3	action	The player is attacked by the Foreman.
