0	section	When talking to Femi (if you helped her)
1	line	Player	I can't believe they won't let me in!
1	line	Femi	I don't believe all this rubbish about an invasion. If mankind wanted to, they could have invaded before now.
1	line	Player	I really need to see King Narnode. Could you help sneak me in?
1	line	Femi	Well, as you helped me I suppose I could. We'll have to be careful. If I get caught I'll be in the cage!
1	line	Player	OK, what should I do?
1	line	Femi	Jump in the back of the cart. It's a food delivery, we should be fineno period
1	line	Femi	Okay, traveller, you'd better get going.
1	line	Player	Thanks again!
1	line	Femi	That's okay, all the best.
1	action	end
0	section	When talking to Femi (if you didn't help her)
1	line	Femi	Why should I help you, you wouldn't help me!
1	line	Player	Erm I know, but this is an emergency!
1	line	Femi	So was lifting that barrel! Tell you what, call it a round 1000 gold pieces.
1	line	Player	1000 gold pieces!
1	line	Femi	That's right, 1000 and I'll sneak you in.
1	option	No chance!
2	line	Player	No chance!
2	action	end
1	option	Ok then, here you go.
2	line	Player	OK then, here you go.
2	box	You give Femi 1000 coins.
2	line	Femi	Alright, jump in the back of the cart. It's a food delivery, we should be fine.
2	line	Femi	Okay, traveller, you'd better get going.
2	line	Player	Thanks again!
2	line	Femi	That's okay, all the best.
2	action	end
0	section	When talking to Femi again
1	line	Femi	Now, to get this lot to the Grand Tree!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Can I help?
2	line	Player	Can I help?
2	line	Femi	No, you're okay, traveller. I can manage from here.
2	action	end
1	option	I'd better get going!
2	line	Player	I'd better get going!
2	action	end
0	section	When speaking to Glough
1	line	Player	I know what you're up to Glough!
1	line	Glough	You have no idea human!
1	line	Player	You may be able to make a fleet but the tree gnomes will never follow you into battle against humans.
1	line	Glough	So, you know more than I thought! The gnomes fear humanity more than any other race. I just need to give them a push in the right direction. There's nothing you can do traveller! Leave before it's too late!
1	line	Player	King Narnode won't allow it!
1	line	Glough	The King's a fool and a coward! He'll bow to me! You'll soon be back in that cage!
1	action	end
0	section	King Narnode
1	line	Player	King Narnode, I need to talk!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Traveller, what are you doing here? The stronghold has been put on full alert! It's not safe for you here!
1	line	Player	Your highness, I believe Glough is killing the trees in order to make a mass fleet of warships!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	That's an absurd accusation!
1	line	Player	His hatred for humanity is stronger than you know!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	That's enough Traveller, you sound as paranoid as him! Traveller please leave! It's bad enough having one human locked up.
1	action	end
0	section	Charlie
1	line	Player	How are you doing Charlie?
1	line	Charlie	I've been better.
1	line	Player	Glough has some plan to rule Gielinor!
1	line	Charlie	I wouldn't put it past him, the Gnome's crazy!
1	line	Player	I need some proof to convince the King.
1	line	Charlie	Hmm... you could be in luck! Before Glough had me locked up I heard him mention that he'd left his chest key at his girlfriend's house. She lives just west of the toad swamp.
1	line	Player	Okay, I'll see what I can find.
1	action	end
0	section	When speaking to King Narnode
1	line	Player	Hello, your highness.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Please Traveller, if the gnomes see me talking to you they'll revolt against me.
1	line	Player	That's crazy!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Glough's scared the whole town, he expects the humans to attack any day. He's even begun to recruit hundreds of gnome soldiers.
1	line	Player	Don't you understand he's creating his own army?!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Please Traveller, leave before it's too late!
1	action	end
