0	section	Glough's Pet
1	line	Player	Hello?
1	line	Player	Anybody?
1	line	Player	Glough?
1	line	Player	Glough?
1	line	Glough	You really are becoming a headache! Well, at least now you can die knowing you were right, it will save me having to hunt you down like all the other human filth of Gielinor!
1	line	Player	You're crazy, Glough!
1	line	Glough	Bah! Well, soon you'll see, the gnomes are ready to fight, in three weeks this tree will be dead wood, in ten weeks it will be 30 battleships! Finally we will rid the world of the disease called humanity!
1	line	Player	What makes you think I'll let you get away with it?
1	line	Glough	Fool... meet my little friend!
