0	section	When talking to King Narnode without finishing the fight
1	line	Player	Your highness, it's true about Glough I tell you! He's planning to take over Gielinor!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I'm sorry Traveller but it's just not realistic. How could Glough, even with a gnome army, take over?
1	line	Player	He plans to make a fleet of warships from the Grand Tree's wood!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	That's enough Traveller! I've no time for make believe. The tree's still dying. I must get to the truth of this!
1	action	end
