0	section	Saving the Tree
0	section	The End of the Tunnel
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Traveller you're wounded! What happened?
1	line	Player	It's Glough! He set a demon on me!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	What?! Glough?! With a demon?!
1	line	Player	Glough has a store of Daconia rocks further up the passage! He's been accessing the roots from a secret passage at his home.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Never! Not Glough! He's a good gnome at heart!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Guard!
1	line	Gnome guard	Sire!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Go and check out that passage!
1	line	Gnome guard	We found Glough hiding under a horde of Daconia rocks!
1	line	Player	That's what I've been trying to tell you! Glough's been fooling you!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I..I don't know what to say! How could I have been so blind?!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Guard! Call off the military training!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	The humans are not attacking!
1	line	Gnome guard	Yes sir!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	You have my full apologies Traveller! And my gratitude!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	A reward will have to wait though, the tree is still dying! The guards are clearing Glough's rock supply now but there must be more Daconia hidden somewhere in the roots! Help us search, we have little time!
1	action	end
0	section	When talking to King Narnode again
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Traveller, have you managed to find the Daconia?
1	line	Player	No sign of it so far.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	The tree will still die if we don't find it! It could be anywhere!
1	line	Player	Don't worry your highness! We'll find it!
1	action	end
0	section	Searching a root with no Daconia rocks
0	section	Searching a root with the Daconia rock
1	box	You've found a Daconia rock!
