0	section	Daconia Delivered
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Traveller, have you managed to find the Daconia?
1	line	Player	Is this it?
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Yes! Excellent, well done!
1	box	You give the King the Daconia rock.
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	It's incredible, the tree's health is improving already! I don't know what to say, we owe you so much!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	To think Glough had me fooled all along!
1	line	Player	All that matters now is that humans and gnomes can live together in peace!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	I'll drink to that!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	From now on I vow to make this stronghold a welcoming place for all! I'll grant you access to all our facilities.
1	line	Player	Thanks!
1	line	Player	I think!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	It should make your stay here easier. You can use the spirit tree to transport yourself, as well as the gnome glider. I also give you access to our mine.
1	line	Player	Mine?
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	Very few know of the secret mine under the Grand Tree. If you push on the roots just to my north they will seperate and let you pass.
1	line	Player	Strange!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	That's magic trees for you!
1	line	King Narnode Shareen	All the best Traveller and thanks again!
1	line	Player	You too, your highness!
